@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### Query sources debug - MyISAM vs InnoDB differences
# Expected: 200 OK
# Use this endpoint to inspect rerank 后的 sources，不再返回 answer。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/query
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "question": "MyISAM和InnoDB有什么区别?"
}

